    "description": "Médicos, línea de vida is a Mexican medical drama telenovela produced by José Alberto Castro for Televisa and originally broadcast on Las Estrellas from November 11, 2019, to March 15, 2020. The series follows a team of doctors, surgeons, nurses, and medical residents at a prestigious hospital as they balance demanding medical cases with their personal lives. Through stories of love, loss, ethical dilemmas, and professional challenges, they strive to save lives while confronting their own struggles.",
